    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なんだ？\r\nやけにおとなしいぞ……？）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……そうか、お祈りをしてるんだな）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……めぐる",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わっ！\r\nプ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "け、結果が出たんだよね？\r\n待って！　わたし、まだ心の準備が……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、そうはいかないぞ\r\n実はな……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ダメだってばー！\r\nまだ結果は言わないでよー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おめでとう！\r\n三次審査合格だ！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……えっ！？\r\nほ、本当に！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "や、やった！！\r\nプロデューサー、わたしやったよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それだけ喜んでくれるなら、\r\n俺も無理に聞かせた甲斐があったよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あー、ほんとだ！　ひどいよ、もー！\r\nまだダメって、あれだけ言ったのにー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは。悪かったよ\r\nでもめぐるの頑張りが、結果に結びついて良かったな！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！\r\n……あ、それでね",
    "charAnim1": "yes",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim1Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……結果を知ったとき、\r\nプロデューサーはうれしかった？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ……それなら良かった！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……最近ね、一歩ずつだけど、アイドルとして\r\nちゃんと前に進んでるって、実感してるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーが、わたしの隣で歩いてくれてるから、\r\nここまで来れたんだと思うの。だから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7003001050130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー！\r\nすっごく感謝してるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700300105/7003001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（めぐるがこれだけ頑張ってるんだ。\r\nなんとしても応えてやらなくちゃな……）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（『W.I.N.G.』に向けて、\r\n全力でめぐるを支えていくぞ！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]